1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,500
I asked AI to attack mathematics
I barely understand.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,600
It chose Navier–Stokes:
can smooth fluid
become infinitely rough?

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,500
Vortices stretch.
Viscosity smooths.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,800
Its method echoes
Protas and Tao.

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:17,200
It wrote the C++, ran adversarial searches,
read each failure, and designed the next lemma.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,300
I required evidence,
not trust.

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,800
Cheap gates could save weeks;
only survivors received deeper search.

8
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,000
In thirty-three hours, sixteen routes failed;
one partial estimate was proved.

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,700
L4 remains open.
Next decision: 1–3 days.
Experts decide.
